Links
-----

RGI: https://card.mcmaster.ca/analyze/rgi

Github: https://github.com/arpcard/rgi

CARD database: https://card.mcmaster.ca
     ]]>
    </help>
    <citations>
        <citation type="doi">10.1093/nar/gkw1004</citation>
    </citations>
</tool>
